***** PLL 0 *****

Instance Name                 : pll_inst1
Resource                      : PLL_TR0
Locked Pin Name               : pll_locked
Clock Source                  : external
Reference Clock Resource      : GPIOT_P_20
Reference Clock               : gpio_inst1
Feedback Mode                 : core
Feedback Clock                : pll_inst1_CLKOUT0

Mode                          : Integer-N
Reference Clock Frequency     : 100.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 10.0000 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 1
Feedback Multiplier (FBK)     : 54.0000
Pre-Divider (N)               : 1
VCO Frequency                 : 5400.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 2
PLL Frequency                 : 2700.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : pll_inst1_CLKOUT0
Output Divider                : 27
Dynamic Phase Shift           : Disable
Phase Setting                 : 0
Phase Degree                  : 0.0000
Invert Output                 : false
Output Frequency              : 100.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 10.000 ns
Duty Cycle                    : 50.0000 %

Output Clock 1
Clock Pin Name                : clk_100m
Output Divider                : 27
Dynamic Phase Shift           : Disable
Phase Setting                 : 0
Phase Degree                  : 0.0000
Invert Output                 : false
Output Frequency              : 100.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 10.000 ns
Duty Cycle                    : 50.0000 %

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * ((M * FBK) /N)
	    = 100.0000 MHz * ((1*54.0000) /1)
	    = 5400.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 5400.0000 MHz / 2
	    = 2700.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 2700.0000 MHz / 27
	        = 100.0000 MHz
	CLKOUT1 = PLL / CLKOUT1_DIV
	        = 2700.0000 MHz / 27
	        = 100.0000 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 10.000 -name pll_inst1_CLKOUT0 [get_ports {pll_inst1_CLKOUT0}]
	create_clock -period 10.000 -name clk_100m [get_ports {clk_100m}]

